### South America

South America is the **fourth-largest continent** `4th` in the world. It is located primarily in the **Western Hemisphere** and mostly in the **Southern Hemisphere** `WS`.

It is famous for the **Amazon Rainforest**, the **Andes Mountains**, diverse cultures, and rich biodiversity.


:::

