![img](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nh-em0n/QDoc/main/BCS/International%20Affairs/Geography.South%20America/assets/sa_basic_features_map.jpeg)
:::
:::

</md></sn><sn><md>:::.row
:::.col-12 .col-lg-6
#### Location and Boundaries

* **North:** North America and the Caribbean Sea
* **East:** Atlantic Ocean
* **West:** Pacific Ocean
* **South:** Southern Ocean and Antarctica
South America is connected to North America through the narrow region of **Central America**.
